# Every file in this repo is authored with LF endings, and every consumer of
# it (Vite, Node, Vercel's build image) wants LF. Without this, Git on
# Windows checks files out as CRLF and then warns about converting them back
# on every single `git add` — a hundred lines of noise that hide anything
# actually worth reading in the output.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` means: decide for yourself what is text, and store AND
# check out text as LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
